{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And I will set a redemption.</b> That is, besides the fact that they will not enter the land of Goshen, He will further make a redemption even for Israel who are outside the land of Goshen, so that the swarm will not come near them. And He was precise in saying <b>between My people and between your people</b> — meaning, when My people and your people are standing together, HaShem will make a redemption for this one from amidst that one, and upon the non-Israelite He will bring it, and upon the Israelite He will not bring it."], :book :exodus, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:25:51.154703815Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}